{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF1", "text": "Here are the specifics from the city event permit I received. The permit was issued after the draft packet was circulated, and it authorizes the red carpet only in the East Arcade — not the Main Plaza as the draft protocol states. It also requires a 2.4-meter clear pedestrian lane, which is wider than the two-meter public lane in the draft. Additionally, the permit allows the adjacent public walkway to be closed from 5:30 PM to 9:30 PM. I should note I haven't uploaded the permit yet because the city sent the signed PDF to the festival's general permits mailbox rather than to me directly, but I have reviewed it and can confirm these terms."}
```

